上がり、落ち込みや不完全な大人っぽさみたいな感覚がRostelさんの音ゲー楽曲制作の中にある世界観で表現していただけると嬉しいです。\n\n難しいリクエストかとは思いますが、引き受けていただけると幸いです。", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@MagesTarako/works/23", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3152339, "client_id": 3725020, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b85919f6/uploads/origins/919af61d-d373-4f05-a3fc-c4145bc6d479?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=30550260daf7ed76bc194abce348f78a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b85919f6/uploads/origins/919af61d-d373-4f05-a3fc-c4145bc6d479?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=30550260daf7ed76bc194abce348f78a, https://si.imgix.net/b85919f6/uploads/origins/919af61d-d373-4f05-a3fc-c4145bc6d479?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f71f3aa6e82f949ccd8483f9d88504ae 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b85919f6/uploads/origins/919af61d-d373-4f05-a3fc-c4145bc6d479?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b69e465ad2b62ed9df8e6268cf4c0f09 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b85919f6/uploads/origins/919af61d-d373-4f05-a3fc-c4145bc6d479?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cb560910ea3e70f898824503f46e643c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b85919f6/uploads/origins/919af61d-d373-4f05-a3fc-c4145bc6d479?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cb560910ea3e70f898824503f46e643c, https://si.imgix.net/b85919f6/uploads/origins/919af61d-d373-4f05-a3fc-c4145bc6d479?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d9824ac9afebed26fa899ecd59c912c9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b85919f6/uploads/origins/919af61d-d373-4f05-a3fc-c4145bc6d479